d the last day before the next term. Used to resolve relative term references ('C', 'P', 'F') to concrete term codes.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER\", \"name\": \"ACADEMIC_TERM_PARAMETER\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"outgoing\", \"desc\": \"Textbook Information Program (TIP) subject offered table: one row per subject offered in a term within the textbook program scope, with subject identity, offering department/school, responsible faculty, enrollment count, and a flag indicating whether the subject has no course material. Parent of TIP_DETAIL via TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED_KEY.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED\", \"name\": \"TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Textbook Information Program (TIP) subject offered table: one row per subject offered in a term within the textbook program scope, with subject identity, offering department/school, responsible faculty, enrollment count, and a flag indicating whether the subject has no course material. Parent of TIP_DETAIL via TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED_KEY.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED\", \"name\": \"TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"SIS subject code lookup table mapping subject codes and course numbers to their descriptions, departments, and schools. Used to resolve subject code descriptions and to link courses to departments via DEPARTMENT_CODE.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"SIS_SUBJECT_CODE\", \"name\": \"SIS_SUBJECT_CODE\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Library reserve material detail bridge table linking reserve catalog items, library subject offerings, course instructors, and material status per term. Used to count reserved materials per subject and to filter by library material status (e.g. 'U').\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"LIBRARY_